flowchart TB
  UI[Web / Android: voice, display, local preferences, course return/progress]
  API[FastAPI: validation and response schema]
  ROUTE[Intent/context: deterministic actions; open learning]
  DATA[Verified analytics/evidence]
  SOURCES[Five-tier evidence + reviewed course context]
  PROV[Explicit provenance + uncertainty]
  DB[(MariaDB)]
  LLM[Configured model: concise teaching, no farm-fact authority]
  UI --> API --> ROUTE --> DATA --> DB
  ROUTE --> SOURCES
  DATA --> PROV --> LLM --> API
  SOURCES --> PROV
